[
  {
    "start": "00:00:04.235",
    "end": "00:00:08.773",
    "start_seconds": 4.235,
    "end_seconds": 8.773,
    "text": "On October 4, 1997,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:08.806",
    "end": "00:00:13.577",
    "start_seconds": 8.806,
    "end_seconds": 13.577,
    "text": "I walked into a room unlike any room I'd ever entered before."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:14.945",
    "end": "00:00:18.516",
    "start_seconds": 14.945,
    "end_seconds": 18.516,
    "text": "People were standing up, sharing their stories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:20.117",
    "end": "00:00:22.987",
    "start_seconds": 20.117,
    "end_seconds": 22.987,
    "text": "A wave of relief washed over me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:26.123",
    "end": "00:00:27.792",
    "start_seconds": 26.123,
    "end_seconds": 27.792,
    "text": "I got a cup of coffee"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:29.193",
    "end": "00:00:31.028",
    "start_seconds": 29.193,
    "end_seconds": 31.028,
    "text": "and just took everything in."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:33.431",
    "end": "00:00:35.232",
    "start_seconds": 33.431,
    "end_seconds": 35.232,
    "text": "At that point,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:35.266",
    "end": "00:00:37.535",
    "start_seconds": 35.266,
    "end_seconds": 37.535,
    "text": "I was at the lowest point in my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:39.970",
    "end": "00:00:42.139",
    "start_seconds": 39.97,
    "end_seconds": 42.139,
    "text": "I was out of ideas,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:42.173",
    "end": "00:00:45.776",
    "start_seconds": 42.173,
    "end_seconds": 45.776,
    "text": "and I didn't know how I was going to make it out of the condition I was in."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:48.279",
    "end": "00:00:51.248",
    "start_seconds": 48.279,
    "end_seconds": 51.248,
    "text": "Before that date, my life had not been easy."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:52.883",
    "end": "00:00:56.153",
    "start_seconds": 52.883,
    "end_seconds": 56.153,
    "text": "When I was 25 years old, I gave birth to a son."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:00:57.254",
    "end": "00:00:59.123",
    "start_seconds": 57.254,
    "end_seconds": 59.123,
    "text": "We called him K.K."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:02.426",
    "end": "00:01:05.162",
    "start_seconds": 62.426,
    "end_seconds": 65.162,
    "text": "The next thing that happened changed my life forever."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:06.530",
    "end": "00:01:08.099",
    "start_seconds": 66.53,
    "end_seconds": 68.099,
    "text": "He was struck by a car."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:09.533",
    "end": "00:01:11.368",
    "start_seconds": 69.533,
    "end_seconds": 71.368,
    "text": "That is the day I lost him."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:12.736",
    "end": "00:01:14.572",
    "start_seconds": 72.736,
    "end_seconds": 74.572,
    "text": "At only five years old,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:15.506",
    "end": "00:01:16.841",
    "start_seconds": 75.506,
    "end_seconds": 76.84100000000001,
    "text": "he was gone."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.677",
    "end": "00:01:24.482",
    "start_seconds": 79.67699999999999,
    "end_seconds": 84.482,
    "text": "His laughter, his love, his energy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:24.515",
    "end": "00:01:26.083",
    "start_seconds": 84.515,
    "end_seconds": 86.083,
    "text": "were all taken from me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:31.388",
    "end": "00:01:33.757",
    "start_seconds": 91.388,
    "end_seconds": 93.757,
    "text": "My life became a downward spiral."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:37.128",
    "end": "00:01:38.529",
    "start_seconds": 97.128,
    "end_seconds": 98.529,
    "text": "I began to drink."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:39.997",
    "end": "00:01:41.999",
    "start_seconds": 99.997,
    "end_seconds": 101.999,
    "text": "Drinking led to substance use."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.701",
    "end": "00:01:46.637",
    "start_seconds": 103.701,
    "end_seconds": 106.637,
    "text": "For the substance use, I was imprisoned."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:50.307",
    "end": "00:01:52.209",
    "start_seconds": 110.307,
    "end_seconds": 112.209,
    "text": "Every time I left prison,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.910",
    "end": "00:01:54.712",
    "start_seconds": 112.91,
    "end_seconds": 114.712,
    "text": "I swore I wouldn't go back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:55.746",
    "end": "00:02:01.318",
    "start_seconds": 115.74600000000001,
    "end_seconds": 121.318,
    "text": "But I did. Over and over and over again."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:02.119",
    "end": "00:02:05.990",
    "start_seconds": 122.119,
    "end_seconds": 125.99,
    "text": "I remember one day, standing in front of a judge"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:05.990",
    "end": "00:02:09.693",
    "start_seconds": 125.99,
    "end_seconds": 129.693,
    "text": "and asking that judge, \"Is there any help for me?\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:11.962",
    "end": "00:02:14.965",
    "start_seconds": 131.962,
    "end_seconds": 134.965,
    "text": "And the judge sentenced me to prison one more time."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:18.068",
    "end": "00:02:19.537",
    "start_seconds": 138.068,
    "end_seconds": 139.537,
    "text": "No one cared."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:20.704",
    "end": "00:02:22.139",
    "start_seconds": 140.704,
    "end_seconds": 142.139,
    "text": "No one was listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:23.707",
    "end": "00:02:27.011",
    "start_seconds": 143.707,
    "end_seconds": 147.011,
    "text": "But when I walked into that room in 1997,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:28.045",
    "end": "00:02:30.781",
    "start_seconds": 148.04500000000002,
    "end_seconds": 150.781,
    "text": "I was ready to be heard."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:30.781",
    "end": "00:02:34.118",
    "start_seconds": 150.781,
    "end_seconds": 154.118,
    "text": "In the rooms of Alcoholics Anonymous,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:34.118",
    "end": "00:02:35.419",
    "start_seconds": 154.118,
    "end_seconds": 155.41899999999998,
    "text": "they listened."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:38.656",
    "end": "00:02:40.991",
    "start_seconds": 158.656,
    "end_seconds": 160.99099999999999,
    "text": "I took a deep breath and stood up,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:42.359",
    "end": "00:02:45.796",
    "start_seconds": 162.359,
    "end_seconds": 165.796,
    "text": "and said, \"Look what drugs and alcohol have done to me.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:48.265",
    "end": "00:02:51.168",
    "start_seconds": 168.265,
    "end_seconds": 171.168,
    "text": "The immediate compassion,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.202",
    "end": "00:02:53.337",
    "start_seconds": 171.202,
    "end_seconds": 173.337,
    "text": "empathy and love"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:53.370",
    "end": "00:02:56.974",
    "start_seconds": 173.37,
    "end_seconds": 176.974,
    "text": "that rolled off these complete strangers"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:57.007",
    "end": "00:03:00.344",
    "start_seconds": 177.007,
    "end_seconds": 180.344,
    "text": "was enough to put a sizable dent"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.377",
    "end": "00:03:03.981",
    "start_seconds": 180.377,
    "end_seconds": 183.981,
    "text": "in my pain, my shame,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:04.014",
    "end": "00:03:07.551",
    "start_seconds": 184.014,
    "end_seconds": 187.551,
    "text": "my guilt and all that sorrow."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.954",
    "end": "00:03:12.656",
    "start_seconds": 189.954,
    "end_seconds": 192.656,
    "text": "I kept talking,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.656",
    "end": "00:03:14.658",
    "start_seconds": 192.656,
    "end_seconds": 194.658,
    "text": "and they kept listening."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.659",
    "end": "00:03:18.596",
    "start_seconds": 195.659,
    "end_seconds": 198.596,
    "text": "I shared all the thoughts"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.629",
    "end": "00:03:21.599",
    "start_seconds": 198.629,
    "end_seconds": 201.599,
    "text": "I had spent decades trying to silence."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.534",
    "end": "00:03:26.704",
    "start_seconds": 203.534,
    "end_seconds": 206.704,
    "text": "As they listened, I began to heal."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:27.972",
    "end": "00:03:31.875",
    "start_seconds": 207.972,
    "end_seconds": 211.875,
    "text": "Listening saved my life, and it opened a door."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.277",
    "end": "00:03:35.379",
    "start_seconds": 213.277,
    "end_seconds": 215.379,
    "text": "I got sober in Santa Monica,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:36.513",
    "end": "00:03:38.949",
    "start_seconds": 216.513,
    "end_seconds": 218.949,
    "text": "an affluent part of Los Angeles."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.551",
    "end": "00:03:42.453",
    "start_seconds": 220.551,
    "end_seconds": 222.453,
    "text": "And I noticed something there."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.754",
    "end": "00:03:45.489",
    "start_seconds": 223.754,
    "end_seconds": 225.489,
    "text": "People in Santa Monica"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:46.757",
    "end": "00:03:50.127",
    "start_seconds": 226.757,
    "end_seconds": 230.127,
    "text": "weren’t going to prison for substance use,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:50.160",
    "end": "00:03:51.762",
    "start_seconds": 230.16,
    "end_seconds": 231.762,
    "text": "for alcoholism."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.464",
    "end": "00:03:54.698",
    "start_seconds": 233.464,
    "end_seconds": 234.698,
    "text": "And I thought,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:56.700",
    "end": "00:03:59.637",
    "start_seconds": 236.7,
    "end_seconds": 239.637,
    "text": "why didn't that judge give me a paper and say,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.670",
    "end": "00:04:00.904",
    "start_seconds": 239.67000000000002,
    "end_seconds": 240.904,
    "text": "\"Miss Burton,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:02.206",
    "end": "00:04:03.741",
    "start_seconds": 242.206,
    "end_seconds": 243.741,
    "text": "go to AA.”"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:06.010",
    "end": "00:04:08.379",
    "start_seconds": 246.01,
    "end_seconds": 248.379,
    "text": "Was I not worth a piece of paper?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:09.747",
    "end": "00:04:13.384",
    "start_seconds": 249.747,
    "end_seconds": 253.38400000000001,
    "text": "Was I not worth direction toward a solution?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:15.219",
    "end": "00:04:17.821",
    "start_seconds": 255.219,
    "end_seconds": 257.821,
    "text": "So as I got stronger in my recovery,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:18.956",
    "end": "00:04:21.592",
    "start_seconds": 258.956,
    "end_seconds": 261.592,
    "text": "I thought about women just like me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:22.860",
    "end": "00:04:25.195",
    "start_seconds": 262.86,
    "end_seconds": 265.195,
    "text": "cycling in and out of prison,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:26.864",
    "end": "00:04:29.266",
    "start_seconds": 266.864,
    "end_seconds": 269.266,
    "text": "looking for safety and not finding it."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:30.434",
    "end": "00:04:31.902",
    "start_seconds": 270.434,
    "end_seconds": 271.902,
    "text": "So I got a job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:33.871",
    "end": "00:04:35.706",
    "start_seconds": 273.871,
    "end_seconds": 275.706,
    "text": "A minimum wage job."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:37.341",
    "end": "00:04:39.743",
    "start_seconds": 277.341,
    "end_seconds": 279.743,
    "text": "And I saved $13,000."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:41.545",
    "end": "00:04:44.848",
    "start_seconds": 281.545,
    "end_seconds": 284.848,
    "text": "And I took $3,000 of it and put down on a house."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:47.184",
    "end": "00:04:48.752",
    "start_seconds": 287.18399999999997,
    "end_seconds": 288.752,
    "text": "And I bought some furniture."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:50.487",
    "end": "00:04:51.855",
    "start_seconds": 290.487,
    "end_seconds": 291.855,
    "text": "Every morning I’d wake up,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:51.889",
    "end": "00:04:54.024",
    "start_seconds": 291.889,
    "end_seconds": 294.024,
    "text": "and I'd go down to the Greyhound bus station"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:54.058",
    "end": "00:04:56.193",
    "start_seconds": 294.058,
    "end_seconds": 296.193,
    "text": "where women leaving prison were dropped off."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:57.528",
    "end": "00:05:00.364",
    "start_seconds": 297.528,
    "end_seconds": 300.364,
    "text": "And I knew that station well"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:00.364",
    "end": "00:05:04.168",
    "start_seconds": 300.364,
    "end_seconds": 304.168,
    "text": "because I had been dropped off there so many times myself."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:05.002",
    "end": "00:05:08.539",
    "start_seconds": 305.002,
    "end_seconds": 308.539,
    "text": "And as they got off the bus carrying a trash bag of belongings"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:09.373",
    "end": "00:05:11.075",
    "start_seconds": 309.373,
    "end_seconds": 311.075,
    "text": "and hope in their hearts,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:12.509",
    "end": "00:05:15.512",
    "start_seconds": 312.509,
    "end_seconds": 315.512,
    "text": "I would walk up to them and I'd say, \"Girl, I have a house."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:17.081",
    "end": "00:05:19.049",
    "start_seconds": 317.081,
    "end_seconds": 319.049,
    "text": "And if you want to come live there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:20.050",
    "end": "00:05:21.819",
    "start_seconds": 320.05,
    "end_seconds": 321.819,
    "text": "it's a safe place to be."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:22.786",
    "end": "00:05:24.154",
    "start_seconds": 322.786,
    "end_seconds": 324.154,
    "text": "You can come live there.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:25.489",
    "end": "00:05:29.693",
    "start_seconds": 325.489,
    "end_seconds": 329.693,
    "text": "And before long there were 11 of us living in that house."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:30.861",
    "end": "00:05:32.863",
    "start_seconds": 330.861,
    "end_seconds": 332.863,
    "text": "We cooked together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:32.863",
    "end": "00:05:35.299",
    "start_seconds": 332.863,
    "end_seconds": 335.299,
    "text": "We went to meetings together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:35.332",
    "end": "00:05:37.434",
    "start_seconds": 335.332,
    "end_seconds": 337.43399999999997,
    "text": "We shared resources."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:38.535",
    "end": "00:05:40.404",
    "start_seconds": 338.53499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 340.404,
    "text": "We laughed together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:40.404",
    "end": "00:05:41.739",
    "start_seconds": 340.404,
    "end_seconds": 341.739,
    "text": "We cried together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:42.706",
    "end": "00:05:46.009",
    "start_seconds": 342.706,
    "end_seconds": 346.009,
    "text": "But most of all, we healed together."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:47.611",
    "end": "00:05:51.115",
    "start_seconds": 347.611,
    "end_seconds": 351.115,
    "text": "Before long, people saw what I was doing, and they joined me."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:52.249",
    "end": "00:05:54.084",
    "start_seconds": 352.249,
    "end_seconds": 354.084,
    "text": "And we created a team."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:05:55.285",
    "end": "00:05:58.622",
    "start_seconds": 355.28499999999997,
    "end_seconds": 358.622,
    "text": "Today, there [are] 12 houses across Los Angeles."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:00.391",
    "end": "00:06:02.059",
    "start_seconds": 360.391,
    "end_seconds": 362.059,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:03.360",
    "end": "00:06:04.862",
    "start_seconds": 363.36,
    "end_seconds": 364.862,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:07.998",
    "end": "00:06:11.902",
    "start_seconds": 367.998,
    "end_seconds": 371.902,
    "text": "What we built was a house of women helping women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:13.971",
    "end": "00:06:17.674",
    "start_seconds": 373.971,
    "end_seconds": 377.674,
    "text": "Each house is staffed to support its residents"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:19.276",
    "end": "00:06:21.678",
    "start_seconds": 379.276,
    "end_seconds": 381.678,
    "text": "who pay rent,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:21.712",
    "end": "00:06:23.847",
    "start_seconds": 381.712,
    "end_seconds": 383.847,
    "text": "do chores,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:23.881",
    "end": "00:06:25.883",
    "start_seconds": 383.881,
    "end_seconds": 385.883,
    "text": "buy groceries"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:25.916",
    "end": "00:06:29.553",
    "start_seconds": 385.916,
    "end_seconds": 389.553,
    "text": "and learn to be accountable, responsible members of the community."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:31.321",
    "end": "00:06:33.056",
    "start_seconds": 391.321,
    "end_seconds": 393.056,
    "text": "We help them find jobs,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:34.658",
    "end": "00:06:36.827",
    "start_seconds": 394.658,
    "end_seconds": 396.827,
    "text": "learn financial literacy"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:37.761",
    "end": "00:06:39.997",
    "start_seconds": 397.761,
    "end_seconds": 399.997,
    "text": "and help them with any legal issues."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:41.598",
    "end": "00:06:46.003",
    "start_seconds": 401.598,
    "end_seconds": 406.003,
    "text": "As a result, thousands of women have come back to the community"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:46.904",
    "end": "00:06:51.875",
    "start_seconds": 406.904,
    "end_seconds": 411.875,
    "text": "and hundreds of mothers have been reunited with their children."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:53.544",
    "end": "00:06:56.447",
    "start_seconds": 413.544,
    "end_seconds": 416.447,
    "text": "In 2017, I published my memoir,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:57.214",
    "end": "00:06:59.383",
    "start_seconds": 417.214,
    "end_seconds": 419.383,
    "text": "\"Becoming Ms. Burton:"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:06:59.416",
    "end": "00:07:01.685",
    "start_seconds": 419.416,
    "end_seconds": 421.685,
    "text": "From Prison to Recovery"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:01.718",
    "end": "00:07:04.321",
    "start_seconds": 421.718,
    "end_seconds": 424.321,
    "text": "to Leading the Fight for Incarcerated Women.\""
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:05.622",
    "end": "00:07:10.427",
    "start_seconds": 425.622,
    "end_seconds": 430.427,
    "text": "In order to tell my story, I held book talks all over the nation,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:11.295",
    "end": "00:07:12.930",
    "start_seconds": 431.295,
    "end_seconds": 432.93,
    "text": "behind prison walls."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:14.131",
    "end": "00:07:17.301",
    "start_seconds": 434.131,
    "end_seconds": 437.301,
    "text": "There I would listen to women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:18.569",
    "end": "00:07:22.005",
    "start_seconds": 438.569,
    "end_seconds": 442.005,
    "text": "They were pleading for a place to go after they were released."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:23.073",
    "end": "00:07:26.276",
    "start_seconds": 443.073,
    "end_seconds": 446.276,
    "text": "They were sitting with tears streaming down their faces,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:27.845",
    "end": "00:07:30.614",
    "start_seconds": 447.845,
    "end_seconds": 450.614,
    "text": "wanting to rebuild their lives,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:30.614",
    "end": "00:07:33.517",
    "start_seconds": 450.614,
    "end_seconds": 453.517,
    "text": "be reunited with their children,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:33.550",
    "end": "00:07:35.619",
    "start_seconds": 453.55,
    "end_seconds": 455.619,
    "text": "find a job in their community [and]"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:37.254",
    "end": "00:07:39.823",
    "start_seconds": 457.254,
    "end_seconds": 459.823,
    "text": "break free from the criminal justice system."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:41.959",
    "end": "00:07:43.794",
    "start_seconds": 461.959,
    "end_seconds": 463.794,
    "text": "Every year in this country,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:45.295",
    "end": "00:07:48.799",
    "start_seconds": 465.295,
    "end_seconds": 468.799,
    "text": "around two million women are released from prisons and jails."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:50.267",
    "end": "00:07:54.104",
    "start_seconds": 470.267,
    "end_seconds": 474.104,
    "text": "They walk out with a trash bag of belongings,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:54.137",
    "end": "00:07:56.773",
    "start_seconds": 474.137,
    "end_seconds": 476.773,
    "text": "hoping someone will listen."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:07:56.807",
    "end": "00:07:58.542",
    "start_seconds": 476.807,
    "end_seconds": 478.54200000000003,
    "text": "Hoping someone will help."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:00.410",
    "end": "00:08:02.045",
    "start_seconds": 480.41,
    "end_seconds": 482.045,
    "text": "When there's no help,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:02.079",
    "end": "00:08:05.048",
    "start_seconds": 482.079,
    "end_seconds": 485.048,
    "text": "when there's no safe place to land,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:05.082",
    "end": "00:08:07.584",
    "start_seconds": 485.082,
    "end_seconds": 487.584,
    "text": "too many of them will go back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:08.819",
    "end": "00:08:15.359",
    "start_seconds": 488.819,
    "end_seconds": 495.359,
    "text": "I knew I could not provide resources of a new way of life"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:15.392",
    "end": "00:08:16.960",
    "start_seconds": 495.392,
    "end_seconds": 496.96,
    "text": "to all those women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:18.862",
    "end": "00:08:21.465",
    "start_seconds": 498.862,
    "end_seconds": 501.465,
    "text": "So I created SAFE,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:21.498",
    "end": "00:08:24.401",
    "start_seconds": 501.498,
    "end_seconds": 504.401,
    "text": "Sisterhood Alliance for Freedom and Equality,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:26.470",
    "end": "00:08:28.005",
    "start_seconds": 506.47,
    "end_seconds": 508.005,
    "text": "to replicate my model."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:28.906",
    "end": "00:08:32.009",
    "start_seconds": 508.906,
    "end_seconds": 512.009,
    "text": "Our first training was with 13 women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:34.077",
    "end": "00:08:36.713",
    "start_seconds": 514.077,
    "end_seconds": 516.713,
    "text": "To date, we've trained over 700."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:36.747",
    "end": "00:08:38.782",
    "start_seconds": 516.747,
    "end_seconds": 518.782,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:43.287",
    "end": "00:08:45.255",
    "start_seconds": 523.287,
    "end_seconds": 525.255,
    "text": "To listen."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:45.289",
    "end": "00:08:47.591",
    "start_seconds": 525.289,
    "end_seconds": 527.591,
    "text": "To create support."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:47.624",
    "end": "00:08:48.892",
    "start_seconds": 527.624,
    "end_seconds": 528.892,
    "text": "To give hope."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:50.794",
    "end": "00:08:55.799",
    "start_seconds": 530.794,
    "end_seconds": 535.799,
    "text": "When women like me have safe housing,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:55.832",
    "end": "00:08:58.135",
    "start_seconds": 535.832,
    "end_seconds": 538.135,
    "text": "families reunify,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:08:58.168",
    "end": "00:09:00.504",
    "start_seconds": 538.168,
    "end_seconds": 540.504,
    "text": "recidivism drops"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:00.537",
    "end": "00:09:02.806",
    "start_seconds": 540.537,
    "end_seconds": 542.806,
    "text": "and communities stabilize."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:04.541",
    "end": "00:09:08.111",
    "start_seconds": 544.541,
    "end_seconds": 548.111,
    "text": "I started with one house of women helping women."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:09.246",
    "end": "00:09:14.184",
    "start_seconds": 549.246,
    "end_seconds": 554.184,
    "text": "Today, there is an entire network of women helping women"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:14.217",
    "end": "00:09:17.721",
    "start_seconds": 554.217,
    "end_seconds": 557.721,
    "text": "in 20 US states and also in Uganda,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:18.655",
    "end": "00:09:21.592",
    "start_seconds": 558.655,
    "end_seconds": 561.592,
    "text": "Kenya and Nigeria."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:21.625",
    "end": "00:09:23.694",
    "start_seconds": 561.625,
    "end_seconds": 563.694,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:28.599",
    "end": "00:09:31.969",
    "start_seconds": 568.599,
    "end_seconds": 571.969,
    "text": "We have replication down to a science."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:33.136",
    "end": "00:09:36.340",
    "start_seconds": 573.136,
    "end_seconds": 576.34,
    "text": "The leadership is there, the demand is there,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:36.340",
    "end": "00:09:39.543",
    "start_seconds": 576.34,
    "end_seconds": 579.543,
    "text": "and the goal is clear."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:40.677",
    "end": "00:09:43.513",
    "start_seconds": 580.677,
    "end_seconds": 583.513,
    "text": "More houses in more cities."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:44.615",
    "end": "00:09:48.919",
    "start_seconds": 584.615,
    "end_seconds": 588.919,
    "text": "More mothers reunited with their children."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:48.952",
    "end": "00:09:52.689",
    "start_seconds": 588.952,
    "end_seconds": 592.689,
    "text": "More women breaking a cycle"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:52.723",
    "end": "00:09:54.925",
    "start_seconds": 592.723,
    "end_seconds": 594.925,
    "text": "that has lasted generations."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:09:56.627",
    "end": "00:10:01.298",
    "start_seconds": 596.627,
    "end_seconds": 601.298,
    "text": "I believe we all share a responsibility"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:03.200",
    "end": "00:10:07.838",
    "start_seconds": 603.2,
    "end_seconds": 607.838,
    "text": "to heal the harms caused by the criminal justice system."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:09.373",
    "end": "00:10:11.575",
    "start_seconds": 609.373,
    "end_seconds": 611.575,
    "text": "This is public safety."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:12.542",
    "end": "00:10:15.045",
    "start_seconds": 612.542,
    "end_seconds": 615.045,
    "text": "This is family preservation."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:15.779",
    "end": "00:10:18.248",
    "start_seconds": 615.779,
    "end_seconds": 618.248,
    "text": "This is community repair."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:19.449",
    "end": "00:10:22.219",
    "start_seconds": 619.449,
    "end_seconds": 622.219,
    "text": "When someone listened to me"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:22.252",
    "end": "00:10:26.189",
    "start_seconds": 622.252,
    "end_seconds": 626.189,
    "text": "with compassion rather than judgment,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:26.223",
    "end": "00:10:27.991",
    "start_seconds": 626.223,
    "end_seconds": 627.991,
    "text": "it changed my life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:29.693",
    "end": "00:10:33.864",
    "start_seconds": 629.693,
    "end_seconds": 633.864,
    "text": "My story since that day in 1997,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:35.365",
    "end": "00:10:38.535",
    "start_seconds": 635.365,
    "end_seconds": 638.535,
    "text": "shows what is possible"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:38.535",
    "end": "00:10:41.038",
    "start_seconds": 638.535,
    "end_seconds": 641.038,
    "text": "when people have support,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:42.706",
    "end": "00:10:44.574",
    "start_seconds": 642.706,
    "end_seconds": 644.574,
    "text": "hope"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:44.574",
    "end": "00:10:46.209",
    "start_seconds": 644.574,
    "end_seconds": 646.2090000000001,
    "text": "and determination."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:48.879",
    "end": "00:10:50.847",
    "start_seconds": 648.879,
    "end_seconds": 650.847,
    "text": "I cannot bring my son back."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:10:53.583",
    "end": "00:10:58.422",
    "start_seconds": 653.583,
    "end_seconds": 658.422,
    "text": "But I know every time a woman walks through the doors and finds safety,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:00.757",
    "end": "00:11:03.827",
    "start_seconds": 660.757,
    "end_seconds": 663.827,
    "text": "every time a child is reunited with his mother,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:05.696",
    "end": "00:11:08.532",
    "start_seconds": 665.696,
    "end_seconds": 668.532,
    "text": "every time a woman breaks free"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:08.532",
    "end": "00:11:10.834",
    "start_seconds": 668.532,
    "end_seconds": 670.834,
    "text": "from a cycle that once held me,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:11.902",
    "end": "00:11:15.205",
    "start_seconds": 671.902,
    "end_seconds": 675.205,
    "text": "his legacy goes way beyond his years."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:17.040",
    "end": "00:11:19.776",
    "start_seconds": 677.04,
    "end_seconds": 679.776,
    "text": "I believe he's smiling down on my efforts,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:21.244",
    "end": "00:11:23.747",
    "start_seconds": 681.244,
    "end_seconds": 683.747,
    "text": "and I hope he's proud of his mother."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:24.781",
    "end": "00:11:26.516",
    "start_seconds": 684.781,
    "end_seconds": 686.516,
    "text": "I am so grateful"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:30.220",
    "end": "00:11:32.255",
    "start_seconds": 690.22,
    "end_seconds": 692.255,
    "text": "to be on the TED dot."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:32.289",
    "end": "00:11:34.524",
    "start_seconds": 692.289,
    "end_seconds": 694.524,
    "text": "(Laughter and Cheers)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:11:34.558",
    "end": "00:11:36.626",
    "start_seconds": 694.558,
    "end_seconds": 696.626,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:04.054",
    "end": "00:12:09.526",
    "start_seconds": 724.054,
    "end_seconds": 729.526,
    "text": "And this happened because someone listened"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:09.559",
    "end": "00:12:13.697",
    "start_seconds": 729.559,
    "end_seconds": 733.697,
    "text": "with compassion rather than judgment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:13.697",
    "end": "00:12:15.098",
    "start_seconds": 733.697,
    "end_seconds": 735.098,
    "text": "Thank you so much."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:12:15.132",
    "end": "00:12:17.000",
    "start_seconds": 735.132,
    "end_seconds": 737.0,
    "text": "(Applause)"
  }
]
